# zenray-japanese : rules, append only (12 October 2026)

Standing rules of this project, one line each, loaded automatically at session start. Full history and context: FEEDBACK.md in this folder. A rule that changes gets a new line citing the old one. (12 October 2026)

- Le projet Assets se nomme zenray-japanese ; sauvegarde récursive progressive ; Japanese1 conserve seulement le vécu et les acquis, Japanese2 porte le corpus langue, Japanese3 porte le Japon, couverture manquante toujours visible. (12 October 2026) <!-- rule:2cfe8de564fd -->
